    /// <summary>
    /// « Étiquettes (PDF) »: every label of the file again, as the workstation's « Imprimer les
    /// étiquettes » — against a reason, recorded on each tube (SampleWorkflowService.ReprintLabelsAsync)
    /// — downloaded as the label PDF, since the browser cannot reach the label printer.
